# No emojis in schedulers

Never use emojis in scheduled tasks, hourly workers, Gmail labels, outreach or follow-up emails, pipeline sheets, Feedback tabs, or playbook copy for Airsup supplier growth.

If an existing scheduled task title, email, label, or sheet header has an emoji, remove it. Do not add new ones.

Plain text only. No decorative symbols in subject lines or labels.
